{
 "id": "CACHE-15-bar-forms",
 "note": "0.1.13: the meter's forms: --ascii (# and -, kw, ...), also under a locale that names another charset (LC_ALL, else LC_CTYPE, else LANG); --short (`c <suffix>`, `c cold`, `c cmp`), also when COLUMNS is below 60; --left (the time left instead of the age); colour: 16 ANSI colours (blue, yellow from 50%, red from 90%, cyan for keep-warm, magenta cold, none for compacted), reset after the segment, `auto` on unless NO_COLOR is set and not empty or TERM is dumb, `always` over NO_COLOR, `never` off. An unknown --color word is a usage error: stderr, exit 0. --json is unchanged and wins.",
